              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha akatengeneza lile bamba, taji takatifu, kwa dhahabu safi na kuchora juu yake maneno haya kama vile muhuri huchorwa:",
          "type": "text",
